    },
    "title": {
      "translate": "Riddle Me Azure Bluet: A Sequel",
      "extra": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "description": {
      "color": "light_purple",
      "translate": "The first is to meet an ancient fish and use an azure bluet to land a crit,",
      "extra": [
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The second is to rename a stack of azure bluets to "The Great Flower" in Sanskrit,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The third is to feed an azure bluet to an electrified calf,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The fourth is to help a farmer by using an azure bluet as some draff,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The fifth is to get an azure bluet in the night, but not for free,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The sixth is to use it to feed a childish bee,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The seventh is to rescue a prisoner and gift them a azure bluet bouquet,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The eighth is to craft an explosion colored as an azure bluet - light gray,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The ninth is to pot an azure bluet in the dark for the blind to scent,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The tenth is to end up inside azure bluet colored cement,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The eleventh is to load the strongest llama with azure bluets,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The twelfth is to smash a black azure bluet thief with a mace,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The thirteenth is to plant an azure bluet on a weird dirty block,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The fourteenth is to do the same, except above the long lasting rock,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The fifteenth is to fill up your inventory with azure bluets, including the other hand,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The sixteenth is to plant an azure bluet in a city at the game's end,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The seventeenth is to use an azure bluet to turn blind,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The eighteenth is to win against a zombie in an azure bluet fight,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The nineteenth is to plant an azure bluet while doing the Skyblock advancement,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The twentieth is to hit the sack in an azure bluet's remains, then you'll receive the source of azure bluet's great power, but with a great enhancement."
        },
        {
          "text": "nn"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "text": "Suggested by yakishbek"
        }
      ]
    },
    "announce_to_chat": true,
    "frame": "challenge"
  },
